# sshd_config for ARMtix on dream2lte
# Root login with the documented password is intentionally enabled;
# this device is a text-console Linux port for a single operator.

Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
X11Forwarding no
PrintMotd yes
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
Subsystem	sftp	/usr/lib/ssh/sftp-server
